Screenshots
===========

The one named exception to "no venue data". Images under docs/images/ are
pictures of a live run of the platform on the maintainer's machine. They show
venue-derived figures (trade counts, rates, sizes, timestamps) as they stood at
the moment of capture, and are for illustration only: not a data set, and not
offered as one. docs/images/dashboards/ is made by `make screenshots`
(scripts/screenshots/); each image's capture date and the commit it was taken
at are in docs/images/dashboards/manifest.json and in its caption in
docs/operations/dashboards.md. The three .jpg files directly under docs/images/
were taken by hand from the earlier stack and committed in 2026-01 and
2026-08. Gate (i) of scripts/check-docs.sh fails CI on a raster image anywhere
else in the tree, so this exception cannot spread.

